u8','','','正片$https://play.jisuzyv.com/play/oeEyg5le/index.m3u8','','','','',0,'',''),(8884,2,0,0,'南部档案','南部·档案','nanbudangan',1,'N','','','国产','https://pps.vodfeiss.com/upload/vod/20260611-1/2c9363d445ee341477f4c857770305bb.jpg','','',NULL,'张新成,丁禹兮,姜珮瑶,富大龙,刘令姿,张宸逍,李欢,姜卓君,徐正溪,韩栋,季肖冰,徐振轩,程相,应灏铭,曲高位,寇振海,佟晨洁,屠显智','周靖韬','','','&amp;nbsp;民国初年南洋地区发生的一系列诡异事件。故事以张海盐和张海虾两位南部档案馆的秘密探员为主角，他们调查一起神秘案件，发现案件背后隐藏着军阀利用剧毒植物“黄昏草”散播的阴谋。在调查过程中，张海盐','更新至第33集','',0,'0','','','大陆','国语','2026','','','','','','','',1,0,0,0,0,0,0,869,161,157,363,'',139,758,3.0,897,299,1788352278,1781235190,0,0,0,0,0.0,'','','','','','','','','','<p>&nbsp;民国初年南洋地区发生的一系列诡异事件。故事以张海盐和张海虾两位南部档案馆的秘密探员为主角，他们调查一起神秘案件，发现案件背后隐藏着军阀利用剧毒植物“黄昏草”散播的阴谋。在调查过程中，张海盐和张海虾经历了生死考验，张海虾甚至因此瘫痪。随着线索逐渐清晰，张海盐发现所有的线索都指向一艘大船——南安号……\n该剧改编自南派三叔同名小说。</p>','bfzym3u8$$$ffm3u8$$$dyttm3u8$$$jsm3u8','no$$$no$$$$$$','$$$$$$$$$','第1集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/2bcb1391c305/index.m3u8#第2集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/e8a8e94f4966/index.m3u8#第3集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/6705e73807a9/index.m3u8#第4集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/cbe8683d657c/index.m3u8#第5集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/a4b3d9b21d27/index.m3u8#第6集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/66ba46b9290f/index.m3u8#第7集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/f2fa8c95b9eb/index.m3u8#第8集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/ab572cf0f6a5/index.m3u8#第9集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/4607aeba726b/index.m3u8#第10集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/c7ac2bf74183/index.m3u8#第11集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/c6003d12e054/index.m3u8#第12集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/5ee953d6c650/index.m3u8#第13集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/48716b86f5d8/index.m3u8#第14集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/d134515027a3/index.m3u8#第15集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/cf61d68980a8/index.m3u8#第16集$https://v10.baofeng10.com/video/nanbudangan/491c823