却能刺穿最荒诞的现实。女企业家金芙蓉（孔令美 饰）的赏识让他一朝成名，又在拒绝求爱后跌落云端。一场醉酒坠楼，一场“自杀”闹剧，将他推上流量时代的风口浪尖——前经纪人（闫佩伦 饰）怂恿他“用死亡换销量”翻红网络。而狂热书粉别凡（田嘉瑞 饰）的出现，彻底打乱了这场精心策划的直播骗局，“囧徒”组合由此诞生——过气作家带着中二粉丝开启“求生不得求死不能”的疯癫之旅。','bfzym3u8$$$dyttm3u8','$$$no','$$$','第1集$https://fengbao12.com/video/jiongtuzhiyuyangaobie/97aa47d1c8c2/index.m3u8#第2集$https://fengbao12.com/video/jiongtuzhiyuyangaobie/ac481757c9d3/index.m3u8#第3集$https://fengbao12.com/video/jiongtuzhiyuyangaobie/9cd4011ac586/index.m3u8#第4集$https://fengbao12.com/video/jiongtuzhiyuyangaobie/94c2f4013b6f/index.m3u8#第5集$https://fengbao12.com/video/jiongtuzhiyuyangaobie/d2fca06b5bc8/index.m3u8#第6集$https://fengbao12.com/video/jiongtuzhiyuyangaobie/6ddb169d811d/index.m3u8#第7集$https://fengbao12.com/video/jiongtuzhiyuyangaobie/2280c27b93c5/index.m3u8#第8集$https://fengbao12.com/video/jiongtuzhiyuyangaobie/f4a1d1be17a6/index.m3u8#第9集$https://fengbao12.com/video/jiongtuzhiyuyangaobie/f4b16a91e62c/index.m3u8#第10集$https://fengbao12.com/video/jiongtuzhiyuyangaobie/f408b699808a/index.m3u8#第11集$https://fengbao12.com/video/jiongtuzhiyuyangaobie/9e06685e0584/index.m3u8#第12集$https://fengbao12.com/video/jiongtuzhiyuyangaobie/d49c5d04edbe/index.m3u8#第13集$https://fengbao12.com/video/jiongtuzhiyuyangaobie/e951cc3eb258/index.m3u8#第14集$https://fengbao12.com/video/jiongtuzhiyuyangaobie/ee670f18a4f3/index.m3u8#第15集完结$https://fengbao12.com/video/jiongtuzhiyuyangaobie/172f3a2330b5/index.m3u8$$$第01集$https://vip.dytt-tvs.com/20260831/35061_62f437b9/index.m3u8#第02集$https://vip.dytt-tvs.com/20260831/35062_36179605/index.m3u8#第03集$https://vip.dytt-tvs.com/20260831/35063_397b233c/index.m3u8#第04集$https://vip.dytt-tvs.com/20260831/35078_8c18d1de/index.m3u8#第05集$https://vip.dytt-tvs.com/20260901/35184_8abf3bb5/index.m3u8#第06集$https://vip.dytt-tvs.com/20260901/35188_4a9a54fa/index.m3u8#第07集$https://vip.dytt-tvs.com/20260902/35325_3dab9369/index.m3u8#第08集$https://vip.dytt-tvs.com/20260903/35482_4360d878/index.m3u8#第09集$https://vip.dytt-tvs.com/20260904/35638_3d7a2575/index.m3u8#第10集$https://vip